{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shred in this deep-snow snowmobile simulator with real physics. Big backcountry maps. Fresh pow everywhere. Steep climbs and tight trees mixed with long clean lines. The riding feels natural and the sled reacts to what you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride in a fully open world. It takes ages for you to cross even one map. You find new routes by exploring. Sometimes you climb. Sometimes you weave through trees. Sometimes you just follow the line your friend left in the powder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/37ff410a06e8871d95dcc8218a8ce9f2.poster.avif?t=1766054910\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/37ff410a06e8871d95dcc8218a8ce9f2.webm?t=1766054910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/37ff410a06e8871d95dcc8218a8ce9f2.mp4?t=1766054910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a licensed sled from Lynx, Polaris, or Ski-Doo. Drop in. Lean into the snow. Countersteer. Turn with throttle. When the snow is light you float. When it is heavy you fight your way through. Every run feels a bit different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/0acd031abf4eb1b6ec16b62f581dea1b.poster.avif?t=1766054910\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/0acd031abf4eb1b6ec16b62f581dea1b.webm?t=1766054910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/0acd031abf4eb1b6ec16b62f581dea1b.mp4?t=1766054910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride in a fully open world. It takes ages for you to cross even one map. You find new routes by exploring. Sometimes you climb. Sometimes you weave through trees. Sometimes you just follow the line your friend left in the powder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or ride with others online. Meet people on the mountain, follow them to new spots, or try to keep up..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong>\u2022 Real physics in deep snow<br>\u2022 Licensed sled brands<br>\u2022 Huge open backcountry maps<br>\u2022 Full freeride freedom<br>\u2022 Online multiplayer </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Magnetic Trees","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/eb053cceff0ca9d48d7fab3dda7aee4f77397316.jpg"},{"name":"Tree Hugger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/c99936bff7d8ffd6129a1780d4708a4d5dde8d4a.jpg"},{"name":"Land a Backflip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/5a9e330497cc825d3b54dc0476c324145ea059bc.jpg"},{"name":"Summit Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/e715f54d68829c6cc3cc34abb9f1e804cc654c67.jpg"},{"name":"Above the Clouds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/90384c624e811ebc2b5eb2f89346931af94836bf.jpg"},{"name":"Piston Change!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/0e16c23917b403bbd9298d86d5f0f615d6f81cf7.jpg"},{"name":"On One's Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/2c2a32bc0db957f08c4b1efbd026c1f709d7069e.jpg"},{"name":"Wheelie Wheely Cool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/220f9c83dfdd50c5aa4fee66af353e1a063d2718.jpg"},{"name":"Look Mom, No Skis!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/2e82adf529496728c8efff1155004d4a6c366c0d.jpg"},{"name":"Mount Everest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486740/c7b385dfd6935515a1bc39e8138beea6f0968321.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2486740?t=1766054910","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766054910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/149a1f7c6e91a66bc4ea6935acae4c8f0b0b2613/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1766054910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/149a1f7c6e91a66bc4ea6935acae4c8f0b0b2613/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1766054910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Sledders Roadmap 2025</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/d97eb512e736de961a2e8d046cbf1e5f.avif?t=1766054910\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shred in this deep-snow snowmobile simulator with real physics. Big backcountry maps. Fresh pow everywhere. Steep climbs and tight trees mixed with long clean lines. The riding feels natural and the sled reacts to what you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride in a fully open world. It takes ages for you to cross even one map. You find new routes by exploring. Sometimes you climb. Sometimes you weave through trees. Sometimes you just follow the line your friend left in the powder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/37ff410a06e8871d95dcc8218a8ce9f2.poster.avif?t=1766054910\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/37ff410a06e8871d95dcc8218a8ce9f2.webm?t=1766054910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/37ff410a06e8871d95dcc8218a8ce9f2.mp4?t=1766054910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a licensed sled from Lynx, Polaris, or Ski-Doo. Drop in. Lean into the snow. Countersteer. Turn with throttle. When the snow is light you float. When it is heavy you fight your way through. Every run feels a bit different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/0acd031abf4eb1b6ec16b62f581dea1b.poster.avif?t=1766054910\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/0acd031abf4eb1b6ec16b62f581dea1b.webm?t=1766054910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/extras/0acd031abf4eb1b6ec16b62f581dea1b.mp4?t=1766054910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride in a fully open world. It takes ages for you to cross even one map. You find new routes by exploring. Sometimes you climb. Sometimes you weave through trees. Sometimes you just follow the line your friend left in the powder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or ride with others online. Meet people on the mountain, follow them to new spots, or try to keep up..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong>\u2022 Real physics in deep snow<br>\u2022 Licensed sled brands<br>\u2022 Huge open backcountry maps<br>\u2022 Full freeride freedom<br>\u2022 Online multiplayer </p>","developers":["Hanki Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486740/ce9812db112341f1d71cc9a16d2c800c2abb386a/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1766054910","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved by Hanki Games and Bonus Stage Publishing","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2486740/855764/8750bd728a5bc1d911550e90672e6a1e8281dfd3/1750815706/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742594947","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2486740/855764/8750bd728a5bc1d911550e90672e6a1e8281dfd3/1750815706/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742594947","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2486740/855764/8750bd728a5bc1d911550e90672e6a1e8281dfd3/1750815706/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742594947","id":257117359,"name":"Sledders Official Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117359/1c6820ab8e8b3a230a19699ddc6bd2d15776834a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742594947"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s